1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,500
Found you on Google Maps.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Your photos looked amazing —
I had to come.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
See?! The photos I put up —

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
the bone-marrow toast,
the proper roast —

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
they actually WORK!

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Three weeks ago I told him: stop
reading the chains' profiles on your day off.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,800
Put YOUR food up.

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,800
The thing nobody else has.

9
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,500
Six years he'd been there —

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
and the simplest thing on Google
was the one he'd been skipping.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,200
Look like the place worth driving
across town for. The algorithm does the rest.

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,500
I'm Bella — ciao for now.
